// The filtered object's own local-space origin/size (world units) — lets
// this fragment shader recover a stable world-space coordinate from
// vTextureCoord (which is just a 0..1 UV over the object) regardless of
// the current pan/zoom, so the noise pattern doesn't warp or swim as the
// user zooms the \`world\` container.
